+Spec refs: REQ-VERIFY-6126, SCENARIO-VERIFY-6126-CONSERVATION,
+SCENARIO-VERIFY-6126-ATTRIBUTION, SCENARIO-VERIFY-6126-TEMPLATE,
+SCENARIO-VERIFY-6126-CONTRACT.
+"""
